1.0.0
Release Date: 2025-12-08
Codename: "First Light"

Model: JAX MuZero with TRM (Tiny Recursive Model)
Training: 49,750 iterations on historical crypto data
Assets: 64 top volatile cryptocurrencies
Architecture: TRM encoder + MuZero MCTS planning

Key Features:
- Fast state encoder (27 channels, no correlation matrices)
- Gumbel MuZero search via mctx library
- JAX/Flax implementation for GPU acceleration
- Paper trading capability with Kraken WebSocket

Performance (Training):
- Self-play: ~1.5-2.5 seconds per episode
- Training: ~1.5 seconds per iteration
- Episodes: 200 steps each

Notes:
- This is the first working release
- Known issues: NaN loss during training (system still learns)
- Paper trading has WebSocket timestamp parsing issues (to be fixed)
